<div>
<h3>New Powers Unleashed</h3>

<div>The ingredients gained through Tracking can be used to craft <strong>s=
even powerful new potions</strong> and Shapeshifter Artifact Weapons, while=
 potions can now be enchanted to new levels. Meanwhile, <strong>Awakened We=
apons </strong>can be attuned with unique combinations of traits, allowing =
the bearer to wield immense strength. These weapons may be lost in combat, =
of course, but their traits will live on, telling their story and that of t=
heir owners.</div>
</div>
